{
  "_comment": "Strangler-fig capability ledger. Every capability of the OnlyOffice DocumentServer surface (services/server = the OO fork) with its World-Office Rust implementation and the oracle that proves equivalence. status: legacy (OO Node code canonical) | shadow (rust serves, oracle pending) | canonical (rust + oracle green). oracle kinds: http (live probe against wo-docserver), parity-contracts (server/tests/parity contract-results.json), census (UI marker census), golden (capture-oo-goldens byte/semantic compare), none (oracle to be defined).",
